### Login sebagai admin (wajib dilakukan dulu)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "password"
}

###

# Ganti token di bawah ini dengan hasil dari login
@token = Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

###

### Ambil semua role
GET http://localhost:4000/roles
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### Ambil detail role tertentu
GET http://localhost:4000/roles/8af5d3bd-b159-41c7-95a4-dfc0b28a3e88
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### Buat role baru
POST http://localhost:4000/roles
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Editor",
  "description": "Bisa edit konten",
  "permissionIds": [
    "id-permission-edit",
    "id-permission-view"
  ]
}

###

### Update role
PUT http://localhost:4000/roles/8af5d3bd-b159-41c7-95a4-dfc0b28a3e88
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Editor Baru",
  "description": "Bisa edit & review konten",
  "permissionIds": [
    "id-permission-edit",
    "id-permission-review"
  ]
}

###

### Hapus role
DELETE http://localhost:4000/roles/8af5d3bd-b159-41c7-95a4-dfc0b28a3e88
Authorization: {{token}}
